## Relationship to FRESCO

FRESCO-GUI-PWA is an independent web-based graphical interface and
execution environment for the **FRESCO nuclear-reaction calculation
code**.

FRESCO is not an original work of FRESCO-GUI-PWA.

FRESCO was developed by **I. J. Thompson and contributors** and is
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

The original FRESCO project is available at:

https://github.com/I-Thompson/fresco

The copyright notices, license information, and other attribution
notices contained in the original FRESCO source distribution must be
preserved.

Nothing in this project should be interpreted as a claim of
authorship or ownership of the underlying FRESCO software.

Unless explicitly stated otherwise, **FRESCO-GUI-PWA is an independent
project and is not an official release of, or endorsed by, the FRESCO
developers.**

